    <briefdescription>
<para>Source-oriented artifact package for a LoRA adapter. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_lo_r_a_package" kindref="compound">LoRAPackage</ref> is the rebuildable, source-linked representation of an adapter artifact. It carries the adapter weights hash, the format descriptor, and a parent_hash that links it to the previous version so that the full version history forms a tamper-evident chain.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>package_hash covers all content fields (excluding package_hash itself) and is computed by <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_lo_r_a_package_1a268609b195f8b611d2db376060257e3c" kindref="member">LoRAPackage::computeContentHash()</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
